{
  "content": "{\"summary\":\"Replaced the greeting with a hands-on puzzle about which evidence can actually disprove a rule.\",\"operations\":[{\"op\":\"edit\",\"id\":\"greeting\",\"changes\":{\"title\":\"Which evidence actually matters?\",\"text\":\"Try a one-minute puzzle about checking a claim.\",\"x\":24,\"y\":14,\"width\":650,\"height\":72}},{\"op\":\"create\",\"object\":{\"id\":\"card_setup\",\"kind\":\"text\",\"title\":\"The setup\",\"text\":\"Each card has a letter on one side and a number on the other.\",\"x\":716,\"y\":14,\"width\":340,\"height\":72,\"color\":\"moss\"}},{\"op\":\"create\",\"object\":{\"id\":\"rule_test\",\"kind\":\"scene\",\"title\":\"Test the rule\",\"x\":24,\"y\":100,\"width\":1032,\"height\":420,\"color\":\"blue\",\"interaction\":\"Select every card that could hide a violation of the rule, then press \u201cCheck my choices.\u201d\",\"state\":{\"selected\":[],\"checked\":false},\"html\":\"<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#253238}.experiment{height:100%;padding:18px;background:#f7f9f6;border-radius:16px}.rule{margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:650}.prompt{margin:8px 0 14px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.card{height:160px;border:3px solid #cad2d0;border-radius:14px;background:white;color:#253238;cursor:pointer;padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;font-family:inherit}.card:hover{background:#eef3f6}.card:focus-visible,.tool:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7254a2;outline-offset:3px}.card.picked{border-color:#34708d;background:#e9f3f8}.card.missed{border-color:#b68a20;border-style:dashed}.card.extra{border-color:#b68a20;background:#fff6df}.card.broken{border-color:#be6655;background:#fff0ea}.face{font-size:52px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.face.flipped{font-size:42px}.side{font-size:16px;color:#59666d}.hint{font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;min-height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;text-align:center}.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}.tool{height:44px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:9px;font-family:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#286784;color:white}.tool.secondary{background:#e2e8e5;color:#253238}.tool:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.count{margin-left:auto;font-size:17px;color:#58686d}.feedback{margin:10px 0 0;min-height:48px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.35}.feedback.good{color:#34664e}</style><div class='experiment'><h2 class='rule'>Rule: \u201cIf there\u2019s a vowel on one side, there\u2019s an even number on the other.\u201d</h2><p class='prompt'>Before looking at the backs: select every card that could hide a violation.</p><div class='cards'><button class='card' data-card='A' aria-pressed='false'><span class='face'>A</span><span class='side'>Letter side</span><span class='hint'>Click to select</span></button><button class='card' data-card='D' aria-pressed='false'><span class='face'>D</span><span class='side'>Letter side</span><span class='hint'>Click to select</span></button><button class='card' data-card='4' aria-pressed='false'><span class='face'>4</span><span class='side'>Number side</span><span class='hint'>Click to select</span></button><button class='card' data-card='7' aria-pressed='false'><span class='face'>7</span><span class='side'>Number side</span><span class='hint'>Click to select</span></button></div><div class='toolbar'><button class='tool' id='check'>Check my choices</button><button class='tool secondary' id='reset'>Start over</button><span class='count' id='count'></span></div><p class='feedback' id='feedback' aria-live='polite'></p></div><script>const defaults={selected:[],checked:false};let s={...defaults,...workshop.state};const backs={A:'2',D:'8','4':'K','7':'E'};const hints={A:'Fits the rule here.',D:'Consonants aren\u2019t limited.','4':'Even doesn\u2019t imply vowel.','7':'A counterexample!'};const cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-card]')];function render(){const selected=new Set(s.selected);cards.forEach(el=>{const id=el.dataset.card,picked=selected.has(id),needed=id==='A'||id==='7',revealed=s.checked&&picked;el.className='card'+(picked?' picked':'')+(s.checked&&!picked&&needed?' missed':'')+(s.checked&&picked&&!needed?' extra':'')+(revealed&&id==='7'?' broken':'');el.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(picked));el.setAttribute('aria-label',(picked?'Deselect ':'Select ')+id);const face=el.querySelector('.face');face.textContent=revealed?id+' \u2194 '+backs[id]:id;face.className='face'+(revealed?' flipped':'');el.querySelector('.side').textContent=revealed?'Front \u2194 back':(id==='A'||id==='D'?'Letter side':'Number side');el.querySelector('.hint').textContent=revealed?hints[id]:(s.checked?(needed?'Could hide a violation':'Cannot violate this rule'):(picked?'Selected \u00b7 click to undo':'Click to select'));});document.getElementById('check').disabled=selected.size===0;document.getElementById('count').textContent=selected.size+' of 4 selected';const feedback=document.getElementById('feedback');feedback.className='feedback';if(!s.checked){feedback.textContent='This is a made-up deck. Choose your evidence, then check your choices.';}else if(selected.has('A')&&selected.has('7')&&selected.size===2){feedback.className='feedback good';feedback.textContent='Exactly: only A and 7 could break the rule. A could hide an odd number; 7 could hide a vowel. Here, 7 hides E\u2014so the rule fails.';}else if(!selected.has('A')||!selected.has('7')){feedback.textContent='You missed a possible violation: A could hide an odd number, and 7 could hide a vowel. Neither D nor 4 can violate this rule.';}else{feedback.textContent='You covered both risks, but included harmless cards. The rule doesn\u2019t restrict consonants, and an even number doesn\u2019t have to hide a vowel.';}}function commit(){render();workshop.save({...s});}cards.forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const id=el.dataset.card;s.selected=s.selected.includes(id)?s.selected.filter(v=>v!==id):[...s.selected,id];s.checked=false;commit();}));document.getElementById('check').addEventListener('click',()=>{s.checked=true;commit();});document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{s={...s,selected:[],checked:false};commit();});workshop.onRestore(next=>{s={...defaults,...next};render();});render();</script>\"}}],\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Try an everyday version\",\"instruction\":\"Adapt the same puzzle to the rule 'Anyone drinking alcohol must be at least 18', using the visible cards Beer, Soda, 22, and 16. Keep a short record of my first selection before resetting the puzzle.\"}]}"
}
